<section data-wf-component-id="d3b31fd1-ff58-ffb9-deea-13776913698d" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section white">
        <div class="section-gap large">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="split-grid">
              <div class="section-head faq">
                <div class="section-badge">
                  <div class="section-badge-mark"></div>
                  <div class="font-label">FAQ</div>
                </div>
                <h2 class="section-heading-v1">Question &amp; answer</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-list">
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                  <div class="faq-top">
                    <div class="faq-title">What makes our interior design agency stand out from the rest?</div>
                    <div class="faq-arrow-wrap-v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-p-wrap v3">
                    <p class="faq-summary">One team holds the drawing, the budget and the build, so nothing is lost at a handover. Architecture and interiors are resolved together rather than styled on at the very end.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                  <div class="faq-top">
                    <div class="faq-title">Can I submit unlimited interior design requests?</div>
                    <div class="faq-arrow-wrap-v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-p-wrap v3">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Yes. Send as many as you like and we work through the queue in the order you set. One request stays active at a time, so you always know what the studio is drawing this week.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                  <div class="faq-top">
                    <div class="faq-title">What if I only need interior design help for one project?</div>
                    <div class="faq-arrow-wrap-v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-p-wrap v3">
                    <p class="faq-summary">That is absolutely fine. Single-project work is quoted on its own scope with a fixed fee and a clear end date, and nothing obliges you to carry on once it is handed over.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                  <div class="faq-top">
                    <div class="faq-title">Can I really request unlimited interior design services?</div>
                    <div class="faq-arrow-wrap-v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-p-wrap v3">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Yes, genuinely. Across a month there is no cap on how many you send. We keep just one in progress at a time so each gets full attention instead of everything moving slowly.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                  <div class="faq-top">
                    <div class="faq-title">How quickly will I get my interior design concepts?</div>
                    <div class="faq-arrow-wrap-v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-p-wrap v3">
                    <p class="faq-summary">First concepts land within five working days of the brief being signed off, and revisions come back in two. You see every stage rather than a single reveal at the very end.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                  <div class="faq-top">
                    <div class="faq-title">Are there any limits to the number of interior design requests I can make?</div>
                    <div class="faq-arrow-wrap-v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon plus">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-p-wrap v3">
                    <p class="faq-summary">No hard limit on the total. Your plan sets how many run at once, one on the studio tier and two on the practice tier, and you can reorder the queue whenever priorities shift.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
